###  https://w3id.org/eudpp#abbreviation
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#abbreviation> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                      rdfs:subPropertyOf <https://w3id.org/eudpp#otherName> ;
                                      rdfs:domain <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Substance> ;
                                      rdfs:range xsd:string ;
                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/references> "ESPR Article 7(5)(a)(ii)"@en ;
                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1781/oj> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "An abbreviation used for the substance."@en ;
                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/SOC> ;
                                      rdfs:label "Abbreviation"@en ;
                                      <https://w3id.org/eudpp#sourceStatus> "representation of an information element explicitly required by the cited ESPR provision; the RDF resource itself is an ontology modelling construct."@en .


